{"url": "https://wave.webaim.org/about", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<title>About WAVE</title>\n\t<script src=\"/js/index.js\"></script>\n\t<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n\t<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:ital,wght@0,300..800;1,300..800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles/index.css?ver=3.2\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<nav>\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"/extension\">Browser Extensions</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/standalone\">Stand-alone API/Testing Engine</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/api\">Subscription API</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/aim\">AIM Report</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"/help\">Help</a></li>\n</ul>\n<a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/img/wavelogo.svg\" alt=\"WAVE Web Accessibility Evaluation Tool\" height=\"69\" width=\"182\"></a>\n</nav>\n<div id=\"main_form\" class=\"controls\">\n<form id=\"waveform\" novalidate=\"\">\n<label for=\"input_url\">Web page address:</label><br><input id=\"input_url\" type=\"url\" class=\"control url\"><input class=\"control\" type=\"submit\" id=\"button_wave\" value=\"WAVE\">\n</form>\n</div>\n</header>\n<main>\n\n\n\t<span style=\"float:right;\">\n\t</span>\n\t<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h1>About WAVE</h1>\n\n<p>WAVE is developed and made available as a free community service by <a href=\"http://webaim.org/\">WebAIM</a> at Utah State University. Originally launched in 2001, WAVE has been used to evaluate the accessibility of millions of web pages.</p>\n\n<h2>WAVE developers and contributors over the years</h2>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Jared Smith</li>\n\t<li>Jonathan Whiting</li>\n\t<li>John Northup</li>\n\t<li>Alaina Faust</li>\n\t<li>George Joeckel</li>\n\t<li>Leonard Kasday: The originator of the initial concept for WAVE</li>\n\t<li>Aubrey Taylor</li>\n\t<li>Brock Taylor</li>\n\t<li>Claudio Lu\u00eds Vera</li>\n\t<li>Tom Galloway</li>\n\t<li>Diogenes Hernandez</li>\n\t<li>Aaron Andersen</li>\n\t<li>Paul Bohman</li>\n\t<li>Shane Anderson</li>\n\t<li>Niranjan Maturi</li>\n\t<li>Balaji Varanasi</li>\n\t<li>Jimmy Parija</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>WAVE credits/sponsors</h2>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Developed and administered by <a href=\"http://webaim.org/\">WebAIM (Web Accessibility In Mind)</a> at the <a href=\"https://idrpp.usu.edu/\">Institute for Disability Research, Policy &amp; Practice</a> at <a href=\"https://usu.edu/\">Utah State University</a>.</li>\n\t<li>In memory of Len Kasday, whose ideas first brought this project to light.</li>\n\t<li>Original development sponsored by <a href=\"http://www.temple.edu/instituteondisabilities/\">Temple University Institute on Disabilities</a> with later funding provided in part by a grant funded from the <a href=\"http://www.ed.gov/about/offices/list/osers/index.html\">The Office of Special Education and Rehabilitative Services</a>, U.S. Department of Education. The contents of this tool do not necessarily represent the policy of the Department of Education, and you should not assume endorsement by the Federal Government.</li>\n</ul>\n\n</main>\n<footer>\n\t<div class=\"footerblock\"><a href=\"https://usu.edu/\"><img src=\"/img/web/usu-logo.svg\" alt=\"Utah State University\" style=\"width:70%;\" width=\"504\" height=\"196\"></a></div>\n\t<div class=\"footerblock middle\"><a href=\"https://webaim.org/\"><img src=\"/img/web/WebAIM-logo.svg\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility in Mind\"></a><br>\n\t\tUtah State University<br>\n\t\t6807 Old Main Hill<br>\n\t\tLogan, UT 84322-6807<br>\n\t\t435.797.7024</div>\n\t<div class=\"footerblock\" id=\"footerlinks\">\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li id=\"contact\"><a href=\"/feedback\">Contact Us</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li id=\"sitewide\"><a href=\"/sitewide\">Site-wide WAVE Tools</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li id=\"about\"><a href=\"/about\">About</a>